    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Land Ahoy!!\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761640/extras/0434a4b78bc956efcadc2a65a7d5d439.poster.avif?t=1742623903\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761640/extras/0434a4b78bc956efcadc2a65a7d5d439.webm?t=1742623903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761640/extras/0434a4b78bc956efcadc2a65a7d5d439.mp4?t=1742623903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>&quot;Welcome to 'Kanhoji's Island', a captivating online multiplayer Ludo game set in the heart of a pirate's paradise. Join the legendary Kanhoji and fellow buccaneers in a strategic dice-rolling journey to conquer the isles, where every move is a step closer to becoming the master of the high seas. Will you navigate the challenges and emerge as the ultimate ruler of Kanhoji's Island?&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761640/extras/8a0280e651bbdbb22e2d17969f29d904.avif?t=1742623903\" width=616 height=111 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> Engaging multiplayer battles on the high seas.</strong><br></li><li><strong> Use cunning tactics and dice rolls to outmanoeuvre opponents.</strong><br></li><li><strong> Capture strategic points on the map.</strong><br></li><li><strong> Online multiplayer.</strong><br></li><li><strong> Stunning visuals and immersive sound.</strong></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Land Ahoy!!\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761640/extras/0434a4b78bc956efcadc2a65a7d5d439.poster.avif?t=1742623903\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761640/extras/0434a4b78bc956efcadc2a65a7d5d439.webm?t=1742623903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761640/extras/0434a4b78bc956efcadc2a65a7d5d439.mp4?t=1742623903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>&quot;Welcome to 'Kanhoji's Island', a captivating online multiplayer Ludo game set in the heart of a pirate's paradise. Join the legendary Kanhoji and fellow buccaneers in a strategic dice-rolling journey to conquer the isles, where every move is a step closer to becoming the master of the high seas. Will you navigate the challenges and emerge as the ultimate ruler of Kanhoji's Island?&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761640/extras/8a0280e651bbdbb22e2d17969f29d904.avif?t=1742623903\" width=616 height=111 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong> Engaging multiplayer battles on the high seas.</strong><br></li><li><strong> Use cunning tactics and dice rolls to outmanoeuvre opponents.</strong><br></li><li><strong> Capture strategic points on the map.</strong><br></li><li><strong> Online multiplayer.</strong><br></li><li><strong> Stunning visuals and immersive sound.</strong></li></ul>",
